/P 588 0 R
/ActualText (Add the cans of tomatoes, broth and basil sprigs. Mix this together well making sure that the onion mixture is well blended with the other ingredients. Bring to a boil, then cover, reduce heat to low and simmer until the tomatoes are very soft and are breaking down, about 20 minutes. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [15]
>>
